00:00:00.320 --> 00:00:05.680
Speaker 1: Let's hear from a couple of&nbsp;
other people. Why don't we go to Nathan&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:05.680 --> 00:00:11.920
from California? Nathan, you're on the air.
Speaker 9: Hey, David. I work in the wedding&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:11.920 --> 00:00:20.640
industry and a recently a local politician has&nbsp;
caught some flack on the news for attending a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:20.640 --> 00:00:26.800
private event. And I just wanted to know what&nbsp;
your thoughts on kind of like the hypocrisy&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:32.480
of politicians saying that you&nbsp;
should wear a mask indoors while&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:37.520
